{"id":"744b67e821b17ac7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/607_命令逻辑_Imperative_Logic.md","title":"607 命令逻辑 Imperative Logic","display":"607_命令逻辑_Imperative_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>描述公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{choice}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{choice}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{test}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{test}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"!A=\\operatorname{do}(A),\\qquad c;d=\\operatorname{seq}(c,d),\\qquad c\\sqcup d=\\operatorname{choice}(c,d),\\qquad ?A=\\operatorname{test}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[!A=\\operatorname{do}(A),\\qquad c;d=\\operatorname{seq}(c,d),\\qquad c\\sqcup d=\\operatorname{choice}(c,d),\\qquad ?A=\\operatorname{test}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生公式记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad \\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad \\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式与命令\">2. 公式与命令</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(!A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c;d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\sqcup d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(c\\sqcup d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\">\\(?A\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>判断对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}=(\\{F\\}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607})\\cup(\\{C\\}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}=(\\{F\\}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607})\\cup(\\{C\\}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>公式自由变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令自由变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(!A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(!A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c;d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c\\sqcup d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c\\sqcup d)=\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(c)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-替换\">4. 替换</h1>\n<p>定义有限子集载体及替换支撑：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{607}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\\qquad\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{607}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\},\\qquad\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}:\\operatorname{supp}_{607}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}:\\operatorname{supp}_{607}(\\sigma)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma_F\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FSub}_{607}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_F(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_F(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_F(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_F(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_F(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma_C\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}(\\sigma,c)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CSub}_{607}(\\sigma,c)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(!A)=!\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(!A)=!\\widehat\\sigma_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(c;d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c);\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(c;d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c);\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(c\\sqcup d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c)\\sqcup\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(c\\sqcup d)=\\widehat\\sigma_C(c)\\sqcup\\widehat\\sigma_C(d),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_C(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_C(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma_F(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子，公式和命令的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价均为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-命题公理与公式规则\">5. 命题公理与公式规则</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{607}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A),(F,A\\to B)),(F,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A),(F,A\\to B)),(F,B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-命令规则关系\">6. 命令规则关系</h1>\n<p>命令强化规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A\\to B),(C,!A)),(C,!B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A\\to B),(C,!A)),(C,!B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令合取规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,!A),(C,!B)),(C,!(A\\land B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,!A),(C,!B)),(C,!(A\\land B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>顺序形成规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,c),(C,d)),(C,c;d)):c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,c),(C,d)),(C,c;d)):c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择形成规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,c),(C,d)),(C,c\\sqcup d)):c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((C,c),(C,d)),(C,c\\sqcup d)):c,d\\in\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>测试形成规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A)),(C,?A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}\n=\n\\{(((F,A)),(C,?A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{607}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限依赖序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,J_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},J_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,J_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},J_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\">\\(J_i\\in\\mathsf{Jud}_{607}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列五项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(J_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{J_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{J_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i=(F,A)\">\\(J_i=(F,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{607}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{607}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在较早行构成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{FMP}^{607}\\)</span> 的前提，结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 为这些前提依赖的并。</li>\n<li>存在较早行构成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoW}^{607}\\)</span> 的前提，且公式前提行依赖为空，结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span>，依赖为命令前提依赖。</li>\n<li>存在较早行构成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{DoAnd}^{607}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Seq}^{607}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Choice}^{607}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Test}^{607}\\)</span> 的前提，结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span>，依赖为所有前提依赖的并。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}J\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}J\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在证明中的行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,J_i)\">\\((\\Delta_i,J_i)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i=J\">\\(J_i=J\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>命令可推出性写作</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{607}c\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{607}c\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}(C,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{607}(C,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-执行语义\">9. 执行语义</h1>\n<p>定义状态集合为命题赋值集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{State}_{607}=\\{s:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{State}_{607}=\\{s:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\">\\(s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\)</span> 递归定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns(p)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns(p)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{F,607}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\ \\lor\\ s\\Vdash_{F,607}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(s\\not\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\ \\lor\\ s\\Vdash_{F,607}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命令解释</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{C,607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{C,607}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{State}_{607})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket !A\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,t):t\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket !A\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,t):t\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket ?A\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,s):s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket ?A\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,s):s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket c;d\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,u):\\exists t\\,((s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\land(t,u)\\in\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket c;d\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\{(s,u):\\exists t\\,((s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\land(t,u)\\in\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket c\\sqcup d\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\cup\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket c\\sqcup d\\rrbracket_{C,607}\n=\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\cup\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>判断满足定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Vdash_{607}(F,A)\\Longleftrightarrow s\\Vdash_{F,607}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Vdash_{607}(F,A)\\Longleftrightarrow s\\Vdash_{F,607}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s,t)\\Vdash_{607}(C,c)\\Longleftrightarrow (s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s,t)\\Vdash_{607}(C,c)\\Longleftrightarrow (s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{607}(F,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\bigl((\\forall (F,G)\\in\\Gamma\\ s\\Vdash_{F,607}G)\\Rightarrow s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{607}(F,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\bigl((\\forall (F,G)\\in\\Gamma\\ s\\Vdash_{F,607}G)\\Rightarrow s\\Vdash_{F,607}A\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{607}(C,c)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\bigl((\\forall (C,d)\\in\\Gamma\\ (s,t)\\in\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607})\\Rightarrow (s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{607}(C,c)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathsf{State}_{607}\\bigl((\\forall (C,d)\\in\\Gamma\\ (s,t)\\in\\llbracket d\\rrbracket_{C,607})\\Rightarrow (s,t)\\in\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{C,607}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>命令逻辑的目标判断是命令判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,c)\">\\((C,c)\\)</span> 的推出，而不是公式定理性。构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!A\">\\(!A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c;d\">\\(c;d\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\sqcup d\">\\(c\\sqcup d\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?A\">\\(?A\\)</span> 均有形成、自由变元、替换和规则使用子句。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Imp}_{607}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607},\\mathsf{Subst}_{607},\\operatorname{FSub}_{607},\\operatorname{CSub}_{607},\\mathsf{Ax}_{607},\\mathsf{Rule}_{607},\\vdash_{607},\\Vdash_{607},\n\\mathsf{State}_{607},\\Vdash_{F,607},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{C,607},\\models_{607}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Imp}_{607}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{607},\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},\\mathsf{Jud}_{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{F}^{607},\\operatorname{FV}_{C}^{607},\\mathsf{Subst}_{607},\\operatorname{FSub}_{607},\\operatorname{CSub}_{607},\\mathsf{Ax}_{607},\\mathsf{Rule}_{607},\\vdash_{607},\\Vdash_{607},\n\\mathsf{State}_{607},\\Vdash_{F,607},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{C,607},\\models_{607}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含描述公式、命令构造、句法替换、命令证明关系、状态语义、执行关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与命令","text":"2. 公式与命令","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换","text":"4. 替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-命题公理与公式规则","text":"5. 命题公理与公式规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-命令规则关系","text":"6. 命令规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-执行语义","text":"9. 执行语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{do},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{test}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{do}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seq}:\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\times\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607}\\to\\mathsf{Cmd}_{607},","display":